<title>UK: Transnet sets 150 million rand three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Transnet sets 150 million rand three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TRANSNET</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  REPUBLIC OF SOUTH AFRICA</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.50 PCT MATURITY    07.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.88    PAY DATE    07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50 PCT  REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	BBB+	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BAA1	DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/ZA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  S.AFRICA  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.5	 SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	THIS IS A DEBUT EURORAND BOND FOR TRANSNET</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
